# Ender-3 V3 SE mainboard, chip GD32F303 (every C13 board, some C14 boards).
# Proven: equals the community-tested SE C13 build (NebulaOS community/, Hazok652).
# 28 KiB bootloader, 8 MHz crystal, serial to the Nebula Pad on USART2 (PA3/PA2), 230400.
# expect: CONFIG_FLASH_APPLICATION_ADDRESS=0x8007000 CONFIG_MCU="stm32f103xe" CONFIG_SERIAL_BAUD=230400
CONFIG_LOW_LEVEL_OPTIONS=y
CONFIG_MACH_STM32=y
CONFIG_MACH_STM32F103=y
CONFIG_STM32F103GD_DISABLE_SWD=y
CONFIG_STM32_FLASH_START_7000=y
CONFIG_STM32_CLOCK_REF_8M=y
CONFIG_STM32_SERIAL_USART2=y
CONFIG_SERIAL_BAUD=230400
